      "title": "GitLab CI: Switch back to explicit scheduling.",
      "message": "GitLab CI: Switch back to explicit scheduling.\n\nIt looks like \"extends\" and YAML anchors don't work for scheduling\nrules, at least for the way we're using them. Use explicit rules for\nscheduled jobs.\n",
      "author_name": "Gerald Combs",
